  "root": "Emr",
  "arabic": "عمر",
  "root_idea": {
    "summary": "The root centers on continued life and the extension of time, and on making a place inhabited, cultivated, flourishing, or maintained.",
    "development": "A second associated line concerns elevation, including raised sound, head adornment, and the ritual visit called ʿumrah; the lexical branches ultimately remain distinct from the core meanings of lifespan and habitation.",
